{"context": "et_builder", "data": {"0": "<!-- wp:divi/section {\"module\":{\"meta\":{\"adminLabel\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":\"section\"}}},\"decoration\":{\"layout\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":{\"display\":\"block\"}}},\"background\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":{\"gradient\":{\"enabled\":\"off\"}}}},\"spacing\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":{\"margin\":{\"left\":\"-25px\",\"syncVertical\":\"off\",\"syncHorizontal\":\"off\",\"right\":\"-25px\"}}}}}},\"builderVersion\":\"5.0.0-public-alpha.18.2\"} -->\r\n<!-- wp:divi/row {\"module\":{\"meta\":{\"adminLabel\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":\"row\"}}},\"decoration\":{\"layout\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":{\"display\":\"block\"}}}}},\"builderVersion\":\"5.0.0-public-alpha.18.2\"} -->\r\n<!-- wp:divi/column {\"module\":{\"advanced\":{\"type\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":\"4_4\"}}},\"decoration\":{\"layout\":{\"desktop\":{\"value\":{\"display\":\"block\"}}}}},\"builderVersion\":\"5.0.0-public-alpha.18.2\"} -->\r\n<!-- wp:divi/code {\"content\": {\"innerContent\": {\"desktop\": {\"value\": \"\\u003c!\\u002d\\u002d ============================================================\\n     RM HERO HOSTING \\u2014 Hero de la p\\u00e1gina \\u0022Alojamiento web\\u0022 (Divi 5,\\n     Code Module)\\n     Marca: Rodmedia \\u00b7 Reestructuraci\\u00f3n web\\n     Mismo sistema que los otros cuatro heros: fondo #0f0f1e, l\\u00ednea\\n     superior con brillo, part\\u00edculas conectadas, dos glows difuminados,\\n     Playfair Display (con eje it\\u00e1lico real cargado desde el\\n     principio) + Inter, badge con punto parpadeante, degradado de\\n     marca a 135deg, entrada en scroll, tarjeta 3D con inclinaci\\u00f3n al\\n     cursor.\\n\\n     Segunda vuelta: se abandonan los enlaces de afiliado (Webempresa\\/\\n     SiteGround) a favor de la oferta de hosting gestionado propia de\\n     Rodmedia. Copy nuevo de principio a fin salvo el H1, que se\\n     mantiene; el degradado pasa de \\u0022vive\\u0022 a \\u0022tu negocio\\u0022. Los\\n     proveedores se nombran solo en la l\\u00ednea de confianza bajo la\\n     franja de datos, sin enlazar a ning\\u00fan sitio externo \\u2014 dan\\n     solidez (\\u0022llevamos a\\u00f1os trabajando con ellos\\u0022) sin mandar a\\n     nadie fuera.\\n\\n     Mockup: mismo panel de estado que en la primera vuelta, con la\\n     misma historia (fiabilidad del hosting), pero con el copy que\\n     pediste \\u2014 etiqueta \\u0022Todo funcionando \\u2713\\u0022, el dominio de ejemplo\\n     con una marca \\u0022Actualizado \\u2713\\u0022 en vez de los medidores de uptime\\/\\n     carga, y el aviso \\u0022Copia de seguridad completada \\u00b7 Hoy \\u00b7 03:00\\u0022.\\n\\n     ANTES DE PUBLICAR:\\n     1) Si ya cargas Playfair Display \\/ Inter desde el Theme Builder de\\n        Divi, borra el @import de aqu\\u00ed para evitar cargarlas dos veces.\\n     2) Cambia los href de \\u0022Ver planes de hosting\\u0022 y \\u0022Reservar una\\n        llamada\\u0022 por tus anclas o p\\u00e1ginas reales.\\n     ============================================================ \\u002d\\u002d\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003csection class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting\\u0022 aria-labelledby=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting-title\\u0022\\u003e\\n\\n  \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__bg\\u0022 aria-hidden=\\u0022true\\u0022\\u003e\\n    \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__topline\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c\\/div\\u003e\\n    \\u003ccanvas class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__particles\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c\\/canvas\\u003e\\n    \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__glow rm-hero-hosting__glow\\u002d\\u002dblue\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c\\/div\\u003e\\n    \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__glow rm-hero-hosting__glow\\u002d\\u002dorange\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c\\/div\\u003e\\n  \\u003c\\/div\\u003e\\n\\n  \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__container\\u0022\\u003e\\n\\n    \\u003c!\\u002d\\u002d \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d Columna de texto \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d \\u002d\\u002d\\u003e\\n    \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__content\\u0022 data-animate\\u003e\\n      \\u003cspan class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__badge\\u0022\\u003e\\n        \\u003cspan class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__badge-dot\\u0022 aria-hidden=\\u0022true\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c\\/span\\u003e\\n        Hosting gestionado\\n      \\u003c\\/span\\u003e\\n\\n      \\u003ch1 id=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting-title\\u0022 class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__title\\u0022\\u003e\\n        La casa donde vive \\u003cem\\u003etu negocio\\u003c\\/em\\u003e en internet\\n      \\u003c\\/h1\\u003e\\n\\n      \\u003cp class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__subtitle\\u0022\\u003e\\n        Contratamos, configuramos y vigilamos tu hosting por ti, con copias de seguridad, certificado SSL y actualizaciones incluidas. Si algo falla, lo resolvemos nosotros.\\n      \\u003c\\/p\\u003e\\n\\n      \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__note\\u0022\\u003e\\n        \\u003csvg class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__note-icon\\u0022 width=\\u002218\\u0022 height=\\u002218\\u0022 viewBox=\\u00220 0 24 24\\u0022 fill=\\u0022none\\u0022 aria-hidden=\\u0022true\\u0022\\u003e\\n          \\u003ccircle cx=\\u002212\\u0022 cy=\\u002212\\u0022 r=\\u00229\\u0022 stroke=\\u0022currentColor\\u0022 stroke-width=\\u00221.6\\u0022\\/\\u003e\\n          \\u003cpath d=\\u0022M3 12h18M12 3c2.5 2.6 3.8 5.7 3.8 9s-1.3 6.4-3.8 9c-2.5-2.6-3.8-5.7-3.8-9S9.5 5.6 12 3Z\\u0022 stroke=\\u0022currentColor\\u0022 stroke-width=\\u00221.6\\u0022\\/\\u003e\\n        \\u003c\\/svg\\u003e\\n        \\u003cp\\u003e\\n          \\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u00bfTu web est\\u00e1 en otro proveedor?\\u003c\\/strong\\u003e\\n          La traemos a Rodmedia sin que deje de funcionar.\\n        \\u003c\\/p\\u003e\\n      \\u003c\\/div\\u003e\\n\\n      \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__actions\\u0022\\u003e\\n        \\u003ca href=\\u0022#planes-hosting\\u0022 class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__cta rm-hero-hosting__cta\\u002d\\u002dprimary\\u0022\\u003e\\n          \\u003cspan\\u003eVer planes de hosting\\u003c\\/span\\u003e\\n          \\u003csvg width=\\u002216\\u0022 height=\\u002216\\u0022 viewBox=\\u00220 0 16 16\\u0022 fill=\\u0022none\\u0022 aria-hidden=\\u0022true\\u0022\\u003e\\n            \\u003cpath d=\\u0022M3.5 8h9M8.5 3.5 13 8l-4.5 4.5\\u0022 stroke=\\u0022currentColor\\u0022 stroke-width=\\u00221.5\\u0022 stroke-linecap=\\u0022round\\u0022 stroke-linejoin=\\u0022round\\u0022\\/\\u003e\\n          \\u003c\\/svg\\u003e\\n        \\u003c\\/a\\u003e\\n        \\u003ca href=\\u0022#contacto\\u0022 class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__cta rm-hero-hosting__cta\\u002d\\u002dsecondary\\u0022\\u003e\\n          Reservar una llamada\\n        \\u003c\\/a\\u003e\\n      \\u003c\\/div\\u003e\\n\\n      \\u003cdl class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__stats\\u0022\\u003e\\n        \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__stat\\u0022\\u003e\\n          \\u003cdt\\u003e99,9%\\u003c\\/dt\\u003e\\n          \\u003cdd\\u003eUptime garantizado\\u003c\\/dd\\u003e\\n        \\u003c\\/div\\u003e\\n        \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__stat\\u0022\\u003e\\n          \\u003cdt\\u003eSSL\\u003c\\/dt\\u003e\\n          \\u003cdd\\u003eIncluido\\u003c\\/dd\\u003e\\n        \\u003c\\/div\\u003e\\n        \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__stat\\u0022\\u003e\\n          \\u003cdt\\u003eCopias\\u003c\\/dt\\u003e\\n          \\u003cdd\\u003eDiarias\\u003c\\/dd\\u003e\\n        \\u003c\\/div\\u003e\\n        \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__stat\\u0022\\u003e\\n          \\u003cdt\\u003eMigraci\\u00f3n\\u003c\\/dt\\u003e\\n          \\u003cdd\\u003eIncluida\\u003c\\/dd\\u003e\\n        \\u003c\\/div\\u003e\\n      \\u003c\\/dl\\u003e\\n\\n      \\u003cp class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__trust\\u0022\\u003e\\n        Sobre servidores de SiteGround y Webempresa, con los que llevamos a\\u00f1os trabajando.\\n      \\u003c\\/p\\u003e\\n    \\u003c\\/div\\u003e\\n\\n    \\u003c!\\u002d\\u002d \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d Mockup: estado del hosting en vivo \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d \\u002d\\u002d\\u003e\\n    \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__visual\\u0022 data-animate\\u003e\\n      \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__card-back\\u0022 aria-hidden=\\u0022true\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c\\/div\\u003e\\n\\n      \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__card\\u0022 role=\\u0022img\\u0022\\n           aria-label=\\u0022Panel de estado del hosting de clinicadentalmar.es: todo funcionando, sitio actualizado, copia de seguridad completada hoy a las 03:00.\\u0022\\u003e\\n\\n        \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__shot\\u0022\\u003e\\n          \\u003cspan class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__tag\\u0022\\u003e\\n            \\u003cspan class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__tag-dot\\u0022 aria-hidden=\\u0022true\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c\\/span\\u003e\\n            Todo funcionando\\n          \\u003c\\/span\\u003e\\n\\n          \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__status\\u0022\\u003e\\n            \\u003csvg width=\\u002216\\u0022 height=\\u002216\\u0022 viewBox=\\u00220 0 24 24\\u0022 fill=\\u0022none\\u0022 aria-hidden=\\u0022true\\u0022\\u003e\\n              \\u003ccircle cx=\\u002212\\u0022 cy=\\u002212\\u0022 r=\\u00229\\u0022 stroke=\\u0022currentColor\\u0022 stroke-width=\\u00221.6\\u0022\\/\\u003e\\n              \\u003cpath d=\\u0022M3 12h18M12 3c2.5 2.6 3.8 5.7 3.8 9s-1.3 6.4-3.8 9c-2.5-2.6-3.8-5.7-3.8-9S9.5 5.6 12 3Z\\u0022 stroke=\\u0022currentColor\\u0022 stroke-width=\\u00221.6\\u0022\\/\\u003e\\n            \\u003c\\/svg\\u003e\\n            \\u003cspan class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__status-domain\\u0022\\u003eclinicadentalmar.es\\u003c\\/span\\u003e\\n            \\u003cspan class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__status-badge\\u0022\\u003e\\n              \\u003csvg width=\\u002211\\u0022 height=\\u002211\\u0022 viewBox=\\u00220 0 24 24\\u0022 fill=\\u0022none\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cpath d=\\u0022M4 12.5 9.5 18 20 6\\u0022 stroke=\\u0022currentColor\\u0022 stroke-width=\\u00222.8\\u0022 stroke-linecap=\\u0022round\\u0022 stroke-linejoin=\\u0022round\\u0022\\/\\u003e\\u003c\\/svg\\u003e\\n              Actualizado\\n            \\u003c\\/span\\u003e\\n          \\u003c\\/div\\u003e\\n\\n          \\u003cul class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__features\\u0022\\u003e\\n            \\u003cli\\u003e\\u003csvg width=\\u002212\\u0022 height=\\u002212\\u0022 viewBox=\\u00220 0 24 24\\u0022 fill=\\u0022none\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cpath d=\\u0022M4 12.5 9.5 18 20 6\\u0022 stroke=\\u0022currentColor\\u0022 stroke-width=\\u00222.6\\u0022 stroke-linecap=\\u0022round\\u0022 stroke-linejoin=\\u0022round\\u0022\\/\\u003e\\u003c\\/svg\\u003eCopia de seguridad diaria\\u003c\\/li\\u003e\\n            \\u003cli\\u003e\\u003csvg width=\\u002212\\u0022 height=\\u002212\\u0022 viewBox=\\u00220 0 24 24\\u0022 fill=\\u0022none\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cpath d=\\u0022M4 12.5 9.5 18 20 6\\u0022 stroke=\\u0022currentColor\\u0022 stroke-width=\\u00222.6\\u0022 stroke-linecap=\\u0022round\\u0022 stroke-linejoin=\\u0022round\\u0022\\/\\u003e\\u003c\\/svg\\u003eCertificado SSL incluido\\u003c\\/li\\u003e\\n          \\u003c\\/ul\\u003e\\n        \\u003c\\/div\\u003e\\n\\n        \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__panel\\u0022\\u003e\\n          \\u003cspan class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__panel-label\\u0022\\u003eMonitorizaci\\u00f3n en tiempo real\\u003c\\/span\\u003e\\n          \\u003cspan class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__panel-title\\u0022\\u003eclinicadentalmar.es\\u003c\\/span\\u003e\\n\\n          \\u003cspan class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__panel-btn\\u0022\\u003e\\n            \\u003cspan class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__panel-btn-texto\\u0022\\u003eVer planes de hosting\\u003c\\/span\\u003e\\n          \\u003c\\/span\\u003e\\n        \\u003c\\/div\\u003e\\n      \\u003c\\/div\\u003e\\n\\n      \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__notif\\u0022\\u003e\\n        \\u003cspan class=\\u0022rm-hero-hosting__notif-dot\\u0022 aria-hidden=\\u0022true\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c\\/span\\u003e\\n        \\u003csvg width=\\u002217\\u0022 height=\\u002217\\u0022 viewBox=\\u00220 0 24 24\\u0022 fill=\\u0022none\\u0022 aria-hidden=\\u0022true\\u0022\\u003e\\n          \\u003ccircle cx=\\u002212\\u0022 cy=\\u002212\\u0022 r=\\u00229\\u0022 stroke=\\u0022currentColor\\u0022 stroke-width=\\u00221.6\\u0022\\/\\u003e\\n          \\u003cpath d=\\u0022M8.5 12.5 11 15l4.5-5.5\\u0022 stroke=\\u0022currentColor\\u0022 stroke-width=\\u00221.8\\u0022 stroke-linecap=\\u0022round\\u0022 stroke-linejoin=\\u0022round\\u0022\\/\\u003e\\n        \\u003c\\/svg\\u003e\\n        \\u003cdiv\\u003e\\n          \\u003cstrong\\u003eCopia de seguridad completada\\u003c\\/strong\\u003e\\n          \\u003cspan\\u003eHoy \\u0026#183; 03:00\\u003c\\/span\\u003e\\n        \\u003c\\/div\\u003e\\n      \\u003c\\/div\\u003e\\n    \\u003c\\/div\\u003e\\n\\n  \\u003c\\/div\\u003e\\n\\u003c\\/section\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003cstyle\\u003e\\n  @import url('https:\\/\\/fonts.googleapis.com\\/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,600;0,700;1,600;1,700\\u0026family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700\\u0026display=swap');\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting {\\n    \\u002d\\u002drm-primary: #0f0f1e;\\n    \\u002d\\u002drm-blue: #3a7bd5;\\n    \\u002d\\u002drm-orange: #e8531a;\\n    \\u002d\\u002drm-light: #f8f8fb;\\n    \\u002d\\u002drm-text-muted: #9aa3bd;\\n    \\u002d\\u002drm-text-muted-2: #7d84a0;\\n    \\u002d\\u002drm-radius: 8px;\\n    \\u002d\\u002drm-radius-lg: 20px;\\n    \\u002d\\u002drm-transition: 0.3s ease;\\n    \\u002d\\u002drm-font-display: \\u0022Playfair Display\\u0022, Georgia, \\u0022Times New Roman\\u0022, serif;\\n    \\u002d\\u002drm-font-body: \\u0022Inter\\u0022, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;\\n    \\u002d\\u002drm-loop: 9s;\\n\\n    position: relative;\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n    background: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-primary);\\n    color: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-light);\\n    font-family: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-font-body);\\n    padding: 120px 20px 100px;\\n    box-sizing: border-box;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting *,\\n  .rm-hero-hosting *::before,\\n  .rm-hero-hosting *::after {\\n    box-sizing: inherit;\\n  }\\n\\n  \\/* \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d Fondo: l\\u00ednea de firma + part\\u00edculas + glows \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d *\\/\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__bg {\\n    position: absolute;\\n    inset: 0;\\n    z-index: 0;\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n    pointer-events: none;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__topline {\\n    position: absolute;\\n    top: 0;\\n    left: 0;\\n    right: 0;\\n    height: 3px;\\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(\\u002d\\u002drm-blue), var(\\u002d\\u002drm-orange), var(\\u002d\\u002drm-blue));\\n    background-size: 200% 100%;\\n    animation: rm-hero-hosting-shimmer 6s linear infinite;\\n  }\\n\\n  @keyframes rm-hero-hosting-shimmer {\\n    0% { background-position: 0% 0; }\\n    100% { background-position: 200% 0; }\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__particles {\\n    position: absolute;\\n    inset: 0;\\n    width: 100%;\\n    height: 100%;\\n    display: block;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__glow {\\n    position: absolute;\\n    border-radius: 50%;\\n    filter: blur(100px);\\n    opacity: 0.28;\\n    animation: rm-hero-hosting-float 15s ease-in-out infinite;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__glow\\u002d\\u002dblue {\\n    width: 480px;\\n    height: 480px;\\n    top: -150px;\\n    left: -110px;\\n    background: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-blue);\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__glow\\u002d\\u002dorange {\\n    width: 420px;\\n    height: 420px;\\n    bottom: -170px;\\n    right: -110px;\\n    background: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-orange);\\n    animation-delay: -7s;\\n  }\\n\\n  @keyframes rm-hero-hosting-float {\\n    0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }\\n    50% { transform: translate(26px, 22px) scale(1.07); }\\n  }\\n\\n  \\/* \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d Contenedor \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d *\\/\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__container {\\n    position: relative;\\n    z-index: 1;\\n    max-width: 1140px;\\n    margin: 0 auto;\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    gap: 64px;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__content[data-animate],\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__visual[data-animate] {\\n    opacity: 0;\\n    transform: translateY(24px);\\n    transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__content.is-visible,\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__visual.is-visible {\\n    opacity: 1;\\n    transform: translateY(0);\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__visual[data-animate] {\\n    transition-delay: 0.15s;\\n  }\\n\\n  \\/* \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d Badge \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d *\\/\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__badge {\\n    display: inline-flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    gap: 8px;\\n    padding: 7px 16px;\\n    border-radius: 999px;\\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\\n    font-size: 12px;\\n    font-weight: 600;\\n    letter-spacing: 0.08em;\\n    text-transform: uppercase;\\n    color: #cbd5e1;\\n    margin-bottom: 28px;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__badge-dot {\\n    width: 7px;\\n    height: 7px;\\n    border-radius: 50%;\\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(\\u002d\\u002drm-blue), var(\\u002d\\u002drm-orange));\\n    animation: rm-hero-hosting-blink 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;\\n  }\\n\\n  @keyframes rm-hero-hosting-blink {\\n    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\\n    50% { opacity: 0.25; }\\n  }\\n\\n  \\/* \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d Titular \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d *\\/\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__title {\\n    font-family: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-font-display);\\n    font-weight: 700;\\n    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 1.4rem + 3.4vw, 3.75rem);\\n    line-height: 1.14;\\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\\n    color: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-light);\\n    max-width: 17ch;\\n    margin: 0 0 22px;\\n  }\\n\\n  \\/* inline-block con su propio line-height generoso: la caja del\\n     degradado no depende de qu\\u00e9 fuente acabe cargando (real o\\n     cursiva fabricada por el navegador si el webfont no llega a\\n     tiempo), as\\u00ed las astas altas de la cursiva nunca se recortan *\\/\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__title em {\\n    display: inline-block;\\n    line-height: 1.5;\\n    padding: 0 0.02em;\\n    font-style: italic;\\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(\\u002d\\u002drm-blue), var(\\u002d\\u002drm-orange));\\n    -webkit-background-clip: text;\\n    background-clip: text;\\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__subtitle {\\n    font-size: 17px;\\n    line-height: 1.7;\\n    color: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-text-muted);\\n    max-width: 48ch;\\n    margin: 0 0 32px;\\n  }\\n\\n  \\/* \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d Recuadro de garant\\u00eda (ya tienes hosting) \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d *\\/\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__note {\\n    display: flex;\\n    align-items: flex-start;\\n    gap: 12px;\\n    padding: 16px 20px;\\n    margin-bottom: 28px;\\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);\\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\\n    border-radius: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-radius-lg);\\n    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\\n    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\\n    max-width: 48ch;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__note-icon {\\n    flex-shrink: 0;\\n    margin-top: 2px;\\n    color: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-blue);\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__note p {\\n    margin: 0;\\n    font-size: 14px;\\n    line-height: 1.6;\\n    color: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-text-muted);\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__note strong {\\n    color: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-light);\\n    font-weight: 600;\\n  }\\n\\n  \\/* \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d CTAs \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d *\\/\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__actions {\\n    display: flex;\\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\\n    gap: 18px;\\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__cta {\\n    position: relative;\\n    display: inline-flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    gap: 8px;\\n    font-family: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-font-body);\\n    font-size: 15px;\\n    font-weight: 600;\\n    text-decoration: none;\\n    border-radius: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-radius);\\n    padding: 15px 26px;\\n    transition: transform var(\\u002d\\u002drm-transition), box-shadow var(\\u002d\\u002drm-transition), border-color var(\\u002d\\u002drm-transition), color var(\\u002d\\u002drm-transition);\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__cta\\u002d\\u002dprimary {\\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(\\u002d\\u002drm-blue), var(\\u002d\\u002drm-orange));\\n    color: #ffffff;\\n    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(58, 123, 213, 0.28);\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__cta\\u002d\\u002dprimary::before {\\n    content: \\u0022\\u0022;\\n    position: absolute;\\n    inset: 0;\\n    background: radial-gradient(160px circle at var(\\u002d\\u002drm-mx, 50%) var(\\u002d\\u002drm-my, 50%), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.32), transparent 70%);\\n    opacity: 0;\\n    transition: opacity var(\\u002d\\u002drm-transition);\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__cta\\u002d\\u002dprimary:hover {\\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\\n    box-shadow: 0 16px 34px rgba(232, 83, 26, 0.35);\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__cta\\u002d\\u002dprimary:hover::before {\\n    opacity: 1;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__cta\\u002d\\u002dprimary span,\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__cta\\u002d\\u002dprimary svg {\\n    position: relative;\\n    z-index: 1;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__cta\\u002d\\u002dsecondary {\\n    color: #e5e7eb;\\n    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);\\n    background: transparent;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__cta\\u002d\\u002dsecondary:hover {\\n    border-color: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-blue);\\n    color: #ffffff;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__cta:focus-visible {\\n    outline: 2px solid var(\\u002d\\u002drm-blue);\\n    outline-offset: 3px;\\n  }\\n\\n  \\/* \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d Franja de stats \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d *\\/\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__stats {\\n    display: flex;\\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\\n    margin: 0;\\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\\n    border-radius: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-radius-lg);\\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025);\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n    max-width: 620px;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__stat {\\n    flex: 1 1 0;\\n    min-width: 120px;\\n    padding: 18px 16px;\\n    text-align: center;\\n    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__stat:last-child {\\n    border-right: none;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__stat dt {\\n    font-family: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-font-display);\\n    font-size: 21px;\\n    font-weight: 600;\\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(\\u002d\\u002drm-blue), var(\\u002d\\u002drm-orange));\\n    -webkit-background-clip: text;\\n    background-clip: text;\\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\\n    margin: 0 0 4px;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__stat dd {\\n    margin: 0;\\n    font-size: 11px;\\n    letter-spacing: 0.03em;\\n    text-transform: uppercase;\\n    color: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-text-muted-2);\\n  }\\n\\n  \\/* \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d L\\u00ednea de confianza \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d *\\/\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__trust {\\n    margin: 14px 0 0;\\n    padding: 0 2px;\\n    font-size: 12.5px;\\n    color: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-text-muted-2);\\n  }\\n\\n  \\/* \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d Tarjeta mockup (3D: inclinaci\\u00f3n con el cursor) \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d *\\/\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__visual {\\n    position: relative;\\n    max-width: 420px;\\n    width: 100%;\\n    margin: 0 auto;\\n    padding-bottom: 40px;\\n    perspective: 1400px;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__card-back {\\n    position: absolute;\\n    top: 16px;\\n    right: -14px;\\n    bottom: 26px;\\n    left: 14px;\\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\\n    border-radius: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-radius-lg);\\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\\n    transform: translateZ(-70px) rotate(4deg) scale(0.96);\\n    opacity: 0.55;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__card {\\n    position: relative;\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\\n    border-radius: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-radius-lg);\\n    background: #14151f;\\n    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);\\n    animation: rm-hero-hosting-idle-sway 7s ease-in-out infinite;\\n    transition: transform 0.15s ease-out;\\n    will-change: transform;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__visual.is-interactive .rm-hero-hosting__card {\\n    animation: none;\\n  }\\n\\n  @keyframes rm-hero-hosting-idle-sway {\\n    0%, 100% { transform: rotateY(-5deg) rotateX(2.5deg); }\\n    50% { transform: rotateY(5deg) rotateX(-2.5deg); }\\n  }\\n\\n  \\/* Imagen superior: foto de estudio clara, igual tratamiento que los\\n     otros heros *\\/\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__shot {\\n    position: relative;\\n    padding: 58px 24px 26px;\\n    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 30%, #fbfbfb, #dedee2 80%);\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__tag {\\n    position: absolute;\\n    top: 16px;\\n    left: 16px;\\n    z-index: 3;\\n    display: inline-flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    gap: 6px;\\n    padding: 7px 13px;\\n    border-radius: 999px;\\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(\\u002d\\u002drm-blue), var(\\u002d\\u002drm-orange));\\n    color: #ffffff;\\n    font-size: 11.5px;\\n    font-weight: 700;\\n    letter-spacing: 0.06em;\\n    text-transform: uppercase;\\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__tag-dot {\\n    width: 6px;\\n    height: 6px;\\n    border-radius: 50%;\\n    background: #ffffff;\\n    animation: rm-hero-hosting-blink 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__status {\\n    display: flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    gap: 10px;\\n    padding: 14px 16px;\\n    border-radius: 999px;\\n    background: #ffffff;\\n    border: 1px solid #e2e5ea;\\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(15, 15, 30, 0.08);\\n    color: #6b7290;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__status-domain {\\n    flex: 1;\\n    min-width: 0;\\n    font-family: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-font-body);\\n    font-size: 14px;\\n    color: #1f2430;\\n    white-space: nowrap;\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n    text-overflow: ellipsis;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__status-badge {\\n    flex: none;\\n    display: inline-flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    gap: 4px;\\n    padding: 5px 10px;\\n    border-radius: 999px;\\n    background: rgba(58, 123, 213, 0.1);\\n    color: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-blue);\\n    font-size: 11px;\\n    font-weight: 600;\\n    text-transform: uppercase;\\n    letter-spacing: 0.03em;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__features {\\n    display: flex;\\n    flex-direction: column;\\n    gap: 8px;\\n    margin: 16px 0 0;\\n    padding: 0;\\n    list-style: none;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__features li {\\n    display: flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    gap: 8px;\\n    font-size: 13px;\\n    color: #545b6e;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__features svg {\\n    flex: none;\\n    color: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-blue);\\n  }\\n\\n  \\/* Panel inferior *\\/\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__panel {\\n    position: relative;\\n    padding: 22px 20px 24px;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__panel-label {\\n    display: block;\\n    font-size: 14px;\\n    font-weight: 500;\\n    color: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-text-muted);\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__panel-title {\\n    display: block;\\n    margin: 4px 0 16px;\\n    font-family: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-font-display);\\n    font-size: 22px;\\n    font-weight: 700;\\n    line-height: 1.2;\\n    color: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-light);\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__panel-btn {\\n    position: relative;\\n    display: block;\\n    padding: 13px 20px;\\n    border-radius: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-radius);\\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(\\u002d\\u002drm-blue), var(\\u002d\\u002drm-orange));\\n    color: #ffffff;\\n    font-size: 14px;\\n    font-weight: 600;\\n    text-align: center;\\n    transform: scale(1);\\n    animation: rm-hero-hosting-press var(\\u002d\\u002drm-loop) infinite;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__panel-btn-texto {\\n    position: relative;\\n    z-index: 1;\\n  }\\n\\n  \\/* \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d Tarjeta flotante: copia de seguridad completada \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d *\\/\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__notif {\\n    position: absolute;\\n    left: -8px;\\n    bottom: -18px;\\n    z-index: 2;\\n    display: flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    gap: 12px;\\n    padding: 14px 20px;\\n    background: rgba(15, 15, 30, 0.85);\\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\\n    border-radius: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-radius-lg);\\n    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);\\n    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);\\n    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);\\n    color: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-blue);\\n    opacity: 0;\\n    transform: translateY(12px);\\n    animation: rm-hero-hosting-notif var(\\u002d\\u002drm-loop) infinite;\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__notif-dot {\\n    position: absolute;\\n    top: 10px;\\n    right: 12px;\\n    width: 7px;\\n    height: 7px;\\n    border-radius: 50%;\\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(\\u002d\\u002drm-blue), var(\\u002d\\u002drm-orange));\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__notif div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1px; }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__notif strong {\\n    font-size: 13px;\\n    color: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-light);\\n  }\\n\\n  .rm-hero-hosting__notif span {\\n    font-size: 12px;\\n    color: var(\\u002d\\u002drm-text-muted);\\n  }\\n\\n  \\/* \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d Animaci\\u00f3n en bucle de la tarjeta \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\n     40-46% se \\u0022pulsa\\u0022 el bot\\u00f3n de ver planes\\n     48-88% el aviso \\u0022copia de seguridad completada\\u0022 queda visible\\n     90%    todo vuelve al inicio *\\/\\n  @keyframes rm-hero-hosting-press {\\n    0%, 43%   { transform: scale(1); }\\n    45%       { transform: scale(0.94); }\\n    48%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }\\n  }\\n  @keyframes rm-hero-hosting-notif {\\n    0%, 48%   { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }\\n    52%, 88%  { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\\n    93%, 100% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }\\n  }\\n\\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__topline,\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__glow,\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__badge-dot,\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__tag-dot,\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__panel-btn,\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__notif {\\n      animation: none;\\n    }\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__notif { opacity: 1; transform: none; }\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__content[data-animate],\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__visual[data-animate] {\\n      opacity: 1;\\n      transform: none;\\n      transition: none;\\n    }\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__visual { perspective: none; }\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__card,\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__card-back { transform: none; }\\n  }\\n\\n  \\/* \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d Responsive \\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d\\u002d *\\/\\n  @media (max-width: 980px) {\\n    .rm-hero-hosting {\\n      padding: 90px 20px 60px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__container {\\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\\n      gap: 56px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__visual {\\n      order: -1;\\n      max-width: 420px;\\n      margin: 0 auto;\\n    }\\n\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__title {\\n      max-width: 100%;\\n    }\\n\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__subtitle,\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__note {\\n      max-width: 60ch;\\n    }\\n\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__stats {\\n      max-width: 100%;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  @media (max-width: 767px) {\\n    .rm-hero-hosting {\\n      padding: 64px 16px 40px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__actions {\\n      flex-direction: column;\\n      align-items: stretch;\\n    }\\n\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__cta {\\n      justify-content: center;\\n      text-align: center;\\n    }\\n\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__stat {\\n      min-width: 46%;\\n      border-right: none;\\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\\n    }\\n\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__stat:nth-child(2n) {\\n      border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\\n    }\\n\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__card-back { right: -6px; left: 6px; }\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__visual { padding-bottom: 64px; }\\n    .rm-hero-hosting__notif { left: 8px; right: 8px; }\\n  }\\n\\u003c\\/style\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\n  (function () {\\n    var section = document.querySelector('.rm-hero-hosting');\\n    if (!section) return;\\n\\n    var reduceMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\\n\\n    \\/* Entradas secuenciadas al hacer scroll *\\/\\n    var elements = section.querySelectorAll('[data-animate]');\\n    if (!('IntersectionObserver' in window) || !elements.length) {\\n      elements.forEach(function (el) { el.classList.add('is-visible'); });\\n    } else {\\n      var entryObserver = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {\\n        entries.forEach(function (entry) {\\n          if (entry.isIntersecting) {\\n            entry.target.classList.add('is-visible');\\n            entryObserver.unobserve(entry.target);\\n          }\\n        });\\n      }, { threshold: 0.15 });\\n      elements.forEach(function (el) { entryObserver.observe(el); });\\n    }\\n\\n    \\/* Part\\u00edculas de fondo *\\/\\n    var canvas = section.querySelector('.rm-hero-hosting__particles');\\n    if (canvas \\u0026\\u0026 !reduceMotion) {\\n      var ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\\n      var particles = [];\\n      var count = 44;\\n      var w, h;\\n\\n      function resize() {\\n        w = canvas.width = canvas.offsetWidth;\\n        h = canvas.height = canvas.offsetHeight;\\n      }\\n\\n      function init() {\\n        particles = [];\\n        for (var i = 0; i \\u003c count; i++) {\\n          particles.push({\\n            x: Math.random() * w,\\n            y: Math.random() * h,\\n            vx: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.25,\\n            vy: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.25\\n          });\\n        }\\n      }\\n\\n      function step() {\\n        ctx.clearRect(0, 0, w, h);\\n        for (var i = 0; i \\u003c particles.length; i++) {\\n          var p = particles[i];\\n          p.x += p.vx;\\n          p.y += p.vy;\\n          if (p.x \\u003c 0 || p.x \\u003e w) p.vx *= -1;\\n          if (p.y \\u003c 0 || p.y \\u003e h) p.vy *= -1;\\n        }\\n        for (var i = 0; i \\u003c particles.length; i++) {\\n          for (var j = i + 1; j \\u003c particles.length; j++) {\\n            var a = particles[i], b = particles[j];\\n            var dx = a.x - b.x, dy = a.y - b.y;\\n            var dist = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);\\n            if (dist \\u003c 140) {\\n              ctx.strokeStyle = 'rgba(58,123,213,' + (0.16 * (1 - dist \\/ 140)) + ')';\\n              ctx.lineWidth = 1;\\n              ctx.beginPath();\\n              ctx.moveTo(a.x, a.y);\\n              ctx.lineTo(b.x, b.y);\\n              ctx.stroke();\\n            }\\n          }\\n        }\\n        for (var i = 0; i \\u003c particles.length; i++) {\\n          ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(125,211,252,0.55)';\\n          ctx.beginPath();\\n          ctx.arc(particles[i].x, particles[i].y, 1.4, 0, Math.PI * 2);\\n          ctx.fill();\\n        }\\n        requestAnimationFrame(step);\\n      }\\n\\n      resize();\\n      init();\\n      step();\\n      window.addEventListener('resize', function () {\\n        resize();\\n        init();\\n      });\\n    }\\n\\n    \\/* Tarjeta 3D: inclinaci\\u00f3n con el cursor, igual que en los otros heros *\\/\\n    var visual = section.querySelector('.rm-hero-hosting__visual');\\n    var card = section.querySelector('.rm-hero-hosting__card');\\n    if (visual \\u0026\\u0026 card \\u0026\\u0026 !reduceMotion \\u0026\\u0026 window.matchMedia('(hover: hover)').matches) {\\n      visual.addEventListener('mousemove', function (e) {\\n        var rect = visual.getBoundingClientRect();\\n        var px = (e.clientX - rect.left) \\/ rect.width - 0.5;\\n        var py = (e.clientY - rect.top) \\/ rect.height - 0.5;\\n        var rotateY = px * 24;\\n        var rotateX = py * -24;\\n        visual.classList.add('is-interactive');\\n        card.style.transform = 'rotateY(' + rotateY + 'deg) rotateX(' + rotateX + 'deg) translateZ(24px)';\\n      });\\n      visual.addEventListener('mouseleave', function () {\\n        visual.classList.remove('is-interactive');\\n        card.style.transform = '';\\n      });\\n    }\\n\\n    \\/* Halo del CTA principal siguiendo al cursor *\\/\\n    var primaryCta = section.querySelector('.rm-hero-hosting__cta\\u002d\\u002dprimary');\\n    if (primaryCta \\u0026\\u0026 window.matchMedia('(hover: hover)').matches) {\\n      primaryCta.addEventListener('mousemove', function (e) {\\n        var rect = primaryCta.getBoundingClientRect();\\n        primaryCta.style.setProperty('\\u002d\\u002drm-mx', (e.clientX - rect.left) + 'px');\\n        primaryCta.style.setProperty('\\u002d\\u002drm-my', (e.clientY - rect.top) + 'px');\\n      });\\n    }\\n  })();\\n\\u003c\\/script\\u003e\\n\"}}}, \"builderVersion\": \"5.2.0\"} /-->\r\n<!-- /wp:divi/column -->\r\n<!-- /wp:divi/row -->\r\n<!-- /wp:divi/section -->"}, "presets": {"module": {"divi/section": {"default": "_initial", "items": {"_initial": {"id": "_initial", "moduleName": "divi/section", "name": "Sección predeterminado 1", "attrs": {"module": {"decoration": {"background": {"desktop": {"value": {"gradient": {"enabled": "on", "direction": "1deg", "stops": [{"position": 0, "color": "#212c91"}, {"position": 100, "color": "rgba(12,16,40,0.2)"}], "overlaysImage": "on"}}}}}}}, "styleAttrs": {"module": {"decoration": {"background": {"desktop": {"value": {"gradient": {"stops": [{"position": 0, "color": "#212c91"}, {"position": 100, "color": "rgba(12,16,40,0.2)"}], "enabled": "on", "direction": "1deg", "overlaysImage": "on"}}}}}}}, "renderAttrs": {"module": {"decoration": {"background": {"desktop": {"value": {"gradient": {"stops": [{"position": 0, "color": "#212c91"}, {"position": 100, "color": "rgba(12,16,40,0.2)"}], "enabled": "on", "direction": "1deg", "overlaysImage": "on"}}}}}}}, "version": "5.0.0-public-beta.1", "type": "module", "created": 1773149013, "updated": 1773149013}}}}, "group": {"divi/background": {"default": "1devvqri4s", "items": {"1devvqri4s": {"type": "group", "id": "1devvqri4s", "name": "Fondo 1", "version": "5.12.1", "created": 1788812051307, "updated": 1788812372833, "groupName": "divi/background", "moduleName": "divi/section", "groupId": "contentBackground", "primaryAttrName": "module", "attrs": {"module": {"decoration": {"background": {"desktop": {"value": {"gradient": {"enabled": "off"}}}}}}}, "styleAttrs": {"module": {"decoration": {"background": {"desktop": {"value": {"gradient": {"enabled": "off"}}}}}}}, "renderAttrs": {"module": {"decoration": {"background": {"desktop": {"value": {"gradient": {"enabled": "off"}}}}}}}, "order": 1}}}}}, "global_colors": [], "global_variables": [], "images": [], "thumbnails": []}